@@ -9,6 +9,26 @@ pnpm install && pnpm run start
 
 The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 
+## Agent form tools
+
+The sign-in and sign-up pages expose `sign_in` and `sign_up` through the
+[WebMCP declarative form API](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/webmcp/declarative-api).
+Each tool accepts required `username` and `password` fields and submits through
+the same client-side handler as the visible form. The result is
+`{ success: boolean, message: string }`, with the same feedback shown on the page.
+Registration creates an account; sign-in uses the existing login endpoint.
+
+Tools are available while their form is on the current page in a browser with
+WebMCP enabled. Other browsers retain normal form behavior. No API keys, tokens,
+or credentials are included in tool results.
+
+Run the form tool checks without starting a server (Node 22.18+):
+
+```sh
+node --test tests/form-tools.test.mjs
+pnpm build
+```
+
